  "design": {
    "identity": "Thin masked woodland ritual follower, ivory crescent bone mask, charcoal face void, short moss-green feather mantle, burgundy waist wraps, two bare clawed feet, one curved ivory bone blade held in right hand, left hand empty.",
    "idle": "Feet brace, bent knees pulse, masked head scans, forearms flex and bone blade tilts visibly, mantle sways in a seamless cycle.",
    "attack": "单次连贯的弧形斩击。右手连续举刃、转肩向左下挥，顺势压低重心，刀尖沿原弧收回。",
    "cast": "Squat and fold elbows, rise high on bent legs, both arms sweep into a wide ritual dance, mask bows and mantle flares; settle.",
    "death": "Blade slips to ground, knees fold, masked body falls sideways and mantle settles; no disappearance."
  }
